# The API image is built from the repo root (see compose.yaml) so it can build the Angular app
# in web/ as well. Only those two trees are sent; everything else, private documents included, stays out.
*
!services/api/src/
!web/

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.venv/
**/*.pdf
**/*.epub
**/data/
**/library/
web/e2e/
